{"4415740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Pale Mimic", "steam_appid": 4415740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environment and Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The untamed wilderness of Alaska is beautiful, cold, and unforgiving. As a high-profile fugitive on the run, this desolate landscape is your only hiding spot, with your dog as your sole companion.  But in these woods, the peaceful silence is a lie. The environment is not just your hideaway—it is the hunting ground for something that belongs here more than you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Pale Mimic&quot; is not an infinite survival game; it is a linear, narrative-driven horror experience with a definitive beginning and end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/a4764133ad5e58516234b277069514ae.poster.avif?t=1787929136\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/a4764133ad5e58516234b277069514ae.webm?t=1787929136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/a4764133ad5e58516234b277069514ae.mp4?t=1787929136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cabin is your only refuge, but safety is an illusion. On most days the core of your existence is  hunting large game just to survive a little longer, with only brief respite at the cabin to plan your next move. On other days, the forest will have unexpected surprises for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When outside, the  hunt begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/bbad25cb167db7df9e060a430f040c2c.poster.avif?t=1787929136\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/bbad25cb167db7df9e060a430f040c2c.webm?t=1787929136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/bbad25cb167db7df9e060a430f040c2c.mp4?t=1787929136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When food runs low, you must venture into the frozen forests, where your dog is your guide and key to tracking anything. What starts as a simple hunt for game quickly turns into a struggle for survival. You will track, kill, and butcher large game, but this process is far from easy. As you stalk your prey, something is watching. Keep your wits about you, lest the hunter become the hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/0cee3011d699dc5778ccc5ac0d5e07ef.poster.avif?t=1787929136\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/0cee3011d699dc5778ccc5ac0d5e07ef.webm?t=1787929136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/0cee3011d699dc5778ccc5ac0d5e07ef.mp4?t=1787929136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunted</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must bring the meat back to survive, but the creature is waiting for you to turn your back on the woods. It is fast, strong, and relies on a terrifying form of mimicry to lure you out. As a stalker, it prefers to avoid direct confrontation. It might mimic your dog’s whine to make you open the door, the sound of prey to trick you, or a familiar voice to lure you into a trap. Out here in the middle of nowhere, imitation is the highest form of horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/eec7b859ab7170ba80376417e9ad7264.poster.avif?t=1787929136\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/eec7b859ab7170ba80376417e9ad7264.webm?t=1787929136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/eec7b859ab7170ba80376417e9ad7264.mp4?t=1787929136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environment and Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The untamed wilderness of Alaska is beautiful, cold, and unforgiving. As a high-profile fugitive on the run, this desolate landscape is your only hiding spot, with your dog as your sole companion.  But in these woods, the peaceful silence is a lie. The environment is not just your hideaway—it is the hunting ground for something that belongs here more than you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Pale Mimic&quot; is not an infinite survival game; it is a linear, narrative-driven horror experience with a definitive beginning and end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/a4764133ad5e58516234b277069514ae.poster.avif?t=1787929136\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/a4764133ad5e58516234b277069514ae.webm?t=1787929136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/a4764133ad5e58516234b277069514ae.mp4?t=1787929136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cabin is your only refuge, but safety is an illusion. On most days the core of your existence is  hunting large game just to survive a little longer, with only brief respite at the cabin to plan your next move. On other days, the forest will have unexpected surprises for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When outside, the  hunt begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/bbad25cb167db7df9e060a430f040c2c.poster.avif?t=1787929136\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/bbad25cb167db7df9e060a430f040c2c.webm?t=1787929136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/bbad25cb167db7df9e060a430f040c2c.mp4?t=1787929136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When food runs low, you must venture into the frozen forests, where your dog is your guide and key to tracking anything. What starts as a simple hunt for game quickly turns into a struggle for survival. You will track, kill, and butcher large game, but this process is far from easy. As you stalk your prey, something is watching. Keep your wits about you, lest the hunter become the hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415740/extras/0cee3011d699dc5778ccc5ac0d5e07ef.poster.avif?t=1787929136\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https